  <item>
    <title>东京6年，我去了终身制铁路公司上班</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/652df5e636a1383a666ff986</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">652df5e636a1383a666ff986</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 17 Oct 2023 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客，客座主播大陶邀请到她的前同事虎虎，听他讲讲在日本六年的留学和工作经验。在日本生活一定要会讲日语吗？日本公司的面试到底有多复杂？他为何去了铁路公司上班？和日本同事如何相处？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvrDnHK_Z8aSHsgDeXGo4nASzM5l.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FolQXF24RSIc3CYYMfA0Jxi0PCLP.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuoHoj5ZXxh-pvW6hNGcEyvQmhBg.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>Timeline：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>08</span></strong><span>：</span><strong><span>34 </span></strong><span>在日本生活，懂日语很重要吗？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>11</span></strong><span>：</span><strong><span>44 </span></strong><span>学日语的窍门</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>16</span></strong><span>：</span><strong><span>57 </span></strong><span>在日本的二手奢侈中古店打工</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>24</span></strong><span>：</span><strong><span>19</span></strong><span>考硕士失利，转而去了旅游学校，改变了人生方向</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>30</span></strong><span>：</span><strong><span>47 </span></strong><span>疫情来了，在最糟糕的一年找工作</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>34</span></strong><span>：</span><strong><span>04 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong><span>在日本公司面试是一种怎样的体验？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>45</span></strong><span>：</span><strong><span>20 </span></strong><span>在日本铁路公司上班的体验</span></p><span></span><p><span>背景音乐来自音乐平台——网易云音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾音乐： 《Slipping Away》—— &nbsp;Mariah Carey</span></p><span></span><p><span>大陶小红书：@大陶一直在玩</span></p>]]></description>
