  <item>
    <title>上海独立书店，靠天吃饭！ft.衡山·和集/梯书店</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64e96e9e80c9ec4c5f4e962c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64e96e9e80c9ec4c5f4e962c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 26 Aug 2023 03:16:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天的oh!myga请来了两位嘉宾，一位是上海梯书店的创始人周安迪，一位是在上海衡山·和集工作了8年的元老级人物菜菜，一起来聊聊有关书店的一切。</span></p><span></span><p><span>开独立书店如何选址？书店如何吸引顾客？如何与品牌合作？书店需要社群运用吗？书店运用的困难是什么？大家对于上海独立书店的期待是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>gaga host：大陶 #自由撰稿人 &amp; Modern Woman*主理人</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrROXndmT8JM377rEWs3UewRr0hk.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkEch_g5Kcz5UMsyrE_fQM-EDB3G.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>gaga guest：菜菜 #上海衡山·和集工作者</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjaoqSqXDWgoLPpitA68gQnBDTmD.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvb0ki0psfmzUwBT6lSWvvu17n_P.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>gaga guest：周安迪 #上海梯书店的创始人</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnw77TnbHTKMMw-0V0kRsXZjti-W.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpdpdke5VN1emoeTbMlLPyLP7Ols.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmYNRDNVohPTolgMw0W8NpWfni2A.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>timeline：</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> &nbsp;从出版社工作室到梯书店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">03:40</a> 衡山·和集，从零开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">05:50</a> &nbsp;开梯书店，做好最差的打算</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1024">17:04</a> 衡山·和集开店初始，一个崭新的开局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1400">23:20</a> 梯书店，如何选书？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1640">27:20</a> &nbsp;书店的第一批客人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a> &nbsp;在书店工作是一件很琐碎的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2876">47:56</a> 去书店工作的人是不是都是爱书的人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">1:05:00</a> 书店需要社群运营吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4200">1:10:00</a> 书店运营的困难是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4980">1:23:00</a> 梯书店和品牌的合作方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6300">1:45:00</a> 对上海独立书店的期待</span></p><span></span><p><span>背景音乐来自音乐平台——网易云音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾音乐： 《Venues Flytrap》—— Feng Suave</span></p><span></span><p><span>大陶小红书：@大陶一直在玩</span></p>]]></description>
