  <item>
    <title>夏日欧洲“大溜达”！三位主播在伦敦、罗马、巴塞罗那发来“反卷”生活播报</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64d20e4ff50b650b284bf9dd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64d20e4ff50b650b284bf9dd</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 08 Aug 2023 09:43:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「北上深」三位主播在今年夏天纷纷在欧洲溜达了一圈，贾老师去了伦敦，大陶去了巴塞罗那，朗拿度去了意大利罗马和小镇佩鲁贾。本期节目，三位主播一起聊一聊他们这趟夏日欧洲之旅，通过他们三个不同视角的分享，去共同感受这趟“非目的性”的旅行。 下方准备了大量的旅行记录照片，配合音频浏览效果最佳，像翻阅一本立体杂志一样看看听听。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>gaga host：贾老师 #gagaCMO</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvWLNvUs7a1SYzpBDYYNGudkfsZ1.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoJ5aeMCsBI4wBphqKscLCw5Um-H.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnB37eVhJmix6E3-d0h2eGP4HkBF.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm70MD_LJBmsa-sa7NdraI9or8Dp.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>gaga host：大陶 #自由撰稿人 &amp; Modern Woman*主理人</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl43bZqjumHtZtkcuG-RRCRUoTXI.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvciqLLrCC9vZgCawZl46FseyMrV.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmEVMLKTFr05tYY2gniLtGN7iG91.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>gaga host：蒋欣峰 # GQ智族 生活方式编辑</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlfWmjywus7uu7BmICqck_yqDbjd.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl3YJzH4QkhpjT-VbG0ZZxwopk36.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrgnSsseUujxsxwrQHQon0NDbmtI.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>timeline：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="399">06:39</a> 伦敦生活必不可缺的“PUB文化”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">20:40</a> &nbsp;Market 菜“食”场，是一个城市烟火气的灵魂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1475">24:35</a> 来欧洲怎么不喝点葡萄酒？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2039">33:59</a> 参观V&amp;A DIVA女性展览</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2140">35:40</a> 巴塞罗那 “塞尔达“城市改造计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2238">37:18</a> Super Block计划 ——让街道从为了通勤到为了生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2305">38:25</a> Sopremesa —— 用餐完毕后，在餐桌前停留的轻松闲聊时光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2723">45:23</a> 消失魔法的9又4/3车站</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3372">56:12</a> 在旅行中被感动的瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3529">58:49</a> 在罗马，当你走在街边，时刻都会被震撼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3983">01:06:23</a> 欧洲是怎样的生活方式？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4532">01:15:32</a> 你会选择在哪一座城市驻留生活？</span></p><span></span><p><span>背景音乐来自音乐平台——网易云音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾音乐： 《Dog Days Are Over》—— Florence + The Machine</span></p><span></span><p><span>贾老师微博：@Jennifer_Jiapp</span></p><span></span><p><span>大陶小红书：@大陶一直在玩</span></p><span></span><p><span>Leon小红书：@LUCY_LEON</span></p>]]></description>
