  <item>
    <title>人类学家“田野调查”式的人生实践 —对话跨界音乐人笛笛</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64980fde86eb9d7e4725d79c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64980fde86eb9d7e4725d79c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 25 Jun 2023 09:58:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目嘉宾——音乐人笛笛，同时也是一位人类学者。分享她从“人类学”视角下如何进入不同的人群文化和体验各式生活方式的故事。以及她现在作为音乐人身份，是怎样用音乐创造出一个让人与人连结和共鸣的声音场域，和关于音乐与自身人类学生涯的连结和思考。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>gaga host：Jennifer #gaga CMO</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>gaga guest：笛笛 #Glintwine(热红酒)乐队主唱、创始人</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>耶鲁大学 东亚研究硕士全奖</span></p><span></span><p><span>华盛顿大学 人类学&amp;现代舞双专业本科</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FouXqIURJNJVz2pXd2n-vvWqCL5X.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fns4uCAqw5JJnxp3ao0abUWLlIq_.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtYkF7yS39fRhgAbKHZrulp10uHa.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhcHMe305VJ6MNFUR_xWI4OU7J-K.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr3_07_zhdIMRNzewPR872wNx2JF.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpag_MHLm14H7zQDjn8ppMlDxeHl.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvlURw1raLTCldY_Rp5rEDP3-Vxb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>Timeline：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="279">00:04:39</a> 关于人类学，它究竟是一个什么样的学科？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="578">00:09:38</a> 如何展开田野调查？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">00:17:30</a> 在“田野”中遇见自我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1374">00:22:54</a> 《失落的卫星》描述的是真实的中亚样貌吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2195">00:36:35</a> 在格鲁吉亚找到音乐的去向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2404">00:40:04</a> 格鲁吉亚复音合唱团演唱《康定情歌》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2703">00:45:03</a> 用音乐创造人与人连结和共鸣的声音场域</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4035">01:07:15</a> <la llorona=""> —— Glintwine (热红酒) 乐队</la></span></p><span></span><p><span>贾老师微博：@Jennifer_Jiapp</span></p><span></span><p><span>笛笛公众号：@在路上的笛笛</span></p>]]></description>
