  <item>
    <title>当女性艺术家谈论自我探索、心灵炼金术与人工智能|对话宋三土和何雨</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/648996e1830480fdfae50cbe</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">648996e1830480fdfae50cbe</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Jun 2023 10:30:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天的oh!my ga请来了两位当代艺术创作者：何雨和宋三土，她们的艺术表现形式有着各自不同的探索，但是都对自我探索，奥秘学有浓厚的兴趣与研究。在这期播客中，两位分享了她们对于生命的哲思，艺术创作感悟以及对人工智能的看法。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>gaga guest：宋三土</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlU4dYtXaxnhXOfJMt62Nh5sAL0K.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>SANTU SONG，艺术家，SANTU GALLERY主理人，「X-CREATOR 研究计划」发起人，现工作生活于上海、伦敦。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FppdFioNLnUf4bKjI_v1tWrFqAP9.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqbZk8K3dMwsjjOjjsfCovMbEBBa.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkPsQS550LSB3hO01hhieZT_fXT8.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>gaga guest：何雨</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkRUed0IyIlvywa7H-0ysb-KglqO.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>南京大学文学学士</span></p><span></span><p><span>澳洲新南威尔士大学商科硕士</span></p><span></span><p><span>当代艺术创作者，创作领域涵盖绘画、行为、影像、表演及诗歌。在投身艺术创作之前，她曾经从事职业管理生涯十余年。与当代艺术的某次偶然相遇，是某种奇迹般的启示，把她带到生命的另一种向度，是一个寻找自己、形成真正自我的探索之路。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhUQ8sy0zusURdmAXAld-fm27cTU.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvN7S7fB4FpOFwbDI1an-1Fzl8Lm.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ForP3a0hz_WagH-o0fkrdOSUrLVY.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>Timeline:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a> 两位艺术家自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="487">08:07</a> 宋三土成立女性核心研究“X-CREATOR 研究计划”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="790">13:10</a> &nbsp;宋三土开始身心灵探索的契机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 何雨从上班族到艺术家的自我探索</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1699">28:19</a> 元宇宙为宋三土打开了新世界的门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2120">35:20</a> 何雨对人工智能、ChaptGPT的看法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> &nbsp;冥想对两位创作的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a> 两位谈论心灵炼金术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">56:00</a> 人工智能对人类的影响</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Reference:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Rfjm7n_bAxQDRZN7U76NBA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Rfjm7n_bAxQDRZN7U76NBA"><u><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://artthat.net/2023/05/40180/" data-url="https://artthat.net/2023/05/40180/"><span>artthat.net</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>背景音乐来自平台——网易云音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>顾忠山，红节奏——The Rusty Rails</span></p>]]></description>
