  <item>
    <title>品牌“靠天赋”？市场“靠算数”？｜对谈混果汁联合创始人Edison</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/646352547d934b8505a9a29b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">646352547d934b8505a9a29b</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 16 May 2023 09:52:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目，我们邀请到混果汁的联合创始人&amp;首席品牌官吴轩 Edison，共同探讨“品牌”与“市场”它们真的是对立思维吗？它们有高下之分和从属关系吗？在这个永恒在争夺的问题下，“品牌”和“市场”到底是一对相爱相杀互相牵制、促进的CP，还是水乳交融的“一个整体”？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>gaga host：贾老师 #gaga CMO</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr7TnBKN_HETfW2VMaqYpn4ILWI2.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsRVJ2Fu4KA6XprVYj1Z5fUQxPVE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>gaga guest：Edison #混果汁联合创始人 &amp; 首席品牌官</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frc3ov9cz_DmjF1PvhrEQ1rXxdPv.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuoJVjRQ-93Zs2QADDmQxCFKedPZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft-1JBt0qC4d0JDu6fJzjNYHzMs7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a> 市场与品牌如何平衡的三个阶段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1585">26:25</a> 如何既能保证市场又能保住品牌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1960">32:40</a> 品牌是议价buff，市场是续命buff</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2490">41:30</a> 让品牌与市场形成共识的目标是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2720">45:20</a> 品牌部和市场部的leader的KPI分别应该是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3050">50:50</a> 品牌与市场有高下之分吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3520">58:40</a> 市场人应该具有什么样的素质？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4165">01:09:25</a> 品牌人应该具有什么样的素质？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4545">01:15:45</a> 品牌的使命是为原空白的事物编制意义之网</span></p><span></span><p><span>背景音乐来自音乐平台——网易云音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾音乐来自Owsey, Half Dust &amp; Resotone - 《Lost You To The Gathering Night》</span></p><span></span><p><span>贾老师微博：@Jennifer_Jiapp</span></p><span></span><p><span>混果汁HR 微信：hun_hr</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgdRkRFTHlDoijaW2UbmR-H31w4A.m4a" length="119867389" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:22:35</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuiHY1-84C-MgsEuylEC9V27DFga.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
