  <item>
    <title>从《铃芽之旅》的原风景到当代青年的爱与怕｜对谈吱音ziinlife联合创始人Lily</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/644e77b394d78eb3f7d03ee5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">644e77b394d78eb3f7d03ee5</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 01 May 2023 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目来了新朋友Lily（吱音ziinlife原创家居设计品牌的联合创始人），贾老师、大陶三位将聊一聊她们对于新海诚的电影《铃芽之旅》的想法，由此联想到她们自己的成长与当代年轻人的困惑。Lily也为我们分享了吱音ziinlife与《铃芽之旅》官方合作草太椅的幕后故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>友情提醒：本播客包含《铃芽之旅》大量剧透。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>gaga host：贾老师 #gaga CMO</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnxGYTBsPAzQcFnLT0ZiEdhiGcFl.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fon0SBt3ev3K3nQ_RLKAn0rQOwqb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>gaga guest：Lily #吱音ziinlife 原创家居设计品牌的联合创始人</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fii4unWbS0V9caWi8MM1WCQ-Fydg.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqQjH6O26rx1zAmLYdIKHpTmW2BU.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>gaga host：大陶 #独立撰稿人/Modern Woman*主理人</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvhRroJ7R4BY-iTuc2ffKsRNw1jW.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtDimq_sUPLssOHXJccT8Xx3TGHg.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpk_44yvHvoJEbONEyupzH2BWl6k.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>timeline:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">2:25</a> 《铃芽之旅》不同以往新海诚的世界观吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">9:16</a> &nbsp;Lily：铃芽让我看见“自己”，看到原风景中的小孩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> 《Beef》与《玲芽》处理“原风景”的不同方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">20:40</a> 只有自己才能疗愈自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1329">22:09</a> &nbsp;贾老师为何“爱上”《铃芽》中的草太椅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1239">20:39</a> 一把最简单的椅子，前后NG了8稿方案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2518">41:58</a> 年轻人对于价值与意义的困惑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2901">48:21</a> 铃芽是幸运的，椅子是一个线索，让她找到了“使命感”</span></p><span></span><p><span>背景音乐来自音乐平台——网易云音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾音乐是《铃芽之旅》片尾曲： 《KANATA HALUKA》—— RADWIMPS</span></p><span></span><p><span>贾老师微博：@Jennifer_Jiapp</span></p><span></span><p><span>大陶小红书：@大陶一直在玩</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lily小红书：@一颗爱设计的梨</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrLLJTVi4__-N3jwHZLflScB9MDo.m4a" length="98774021" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:08:03</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuiHY1-84C-MgsEuylEC9V27DFga.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>从事艺术行业，是否需要一个理性的大脑？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64411cbd9361a4e7c30e2370</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64411cbd9361a4e7c30e2370</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 20 Apr 2023 11:06:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>做艺术策展人需要什么背景、知识储备？开画廊的一定二代吗？普通人应该如何去看艺术展？从伦敦华尔街投行辞去了优渥的工作，转身去伦敦佳士得学习艺术史，回国成立了自己的画廊，成为一名艺术策展人，这一期oh!myga播客一时画廊和Fun Matters的创始人白雪与我们分享她学霸式的工作方法和成为画廊主的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>gaga host：大陶 #独立撰稿人/Modern Woman*主理人</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>gaga guest：白雪 #艺术策展人&amp;一时画廊和Fun Matters的创始人</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsuMyjpu8ukPT9QYBdEdPTDiQpWt.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuAsUAv_dAegBAWR00sqalaB9yBX.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flf7supgo9rryDVgimThtIL50c6K.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fus9e9xubkHc7YUUPOXq4nR8Q4qQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">00:46</a> 自己DIY申请去美国读本科</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="688">11:28</a> 读女校带来的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> &nbsp;去英国投行工作，发现不是最喜欢的事业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1289">21:29</a> 开始自我探索，我到底最喜欢什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1685">28:05</a> 学习艺术史之前gap了一年，去各大艺术机构做实习生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2087">34:47</a> 正式去佳士得学艺术史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2670">44:30</a> 回国后在不同领域工作七年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> 开始成立自己的品牌，开画廊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">1:02:00</a> 普通人如何看艺术展览？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4080">1:08:00</a> 如何成为艺术策展人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5212">1:26:52</a> &nbsp;画廊如何盈利？</span></p><span></span><p><span>背景音乐来自音乐平台——网易云音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>大陶小红书：@大陶一直在玩</span></p><span></span><p><span>白雪小红书：@白雪希尔维亚</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmUoQ008fGJ3cUvIDkt6AOyVgu7k.m4a" length="137587917" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:34:48</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuiHY1-84C-MgsEuylEC9V27DFga.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>花火大会、富士音乐节、赏夜樱、泡秘汤，三年之后去日本玩什么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64353e6566e4c00c6ad01f93</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64353e6566e4c00c6ad01f93</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 11 Apr 2023 11:03:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目，“北上广”三位主播分享了他们心目中觉得有意思的日本游玩攻略。干货较多，废话少说，直接上攻略：</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期提到的推荐：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>值得一逛：涩谷Parco、SHIBUYA SKY、南青山、下北泽</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>值得一看：赏夜樱、Fuji Rock、Summer Sonic、感受日本全球独一无二的演出/con体验</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>值得一住：详情看下方shownots附上的《CASA》杂志酒店推荐 list</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>贾老师小众日本自然+传统文化路线推荐：三大灵场之一，日本佛教发源地高野山</span><br><span>熊野古道---伊势神宫（途径熊野三山、古温泉镇）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>日本从4月到8月密集的花火大会：详情见下方2023各地烟花大会guide</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>gaga host：贾老师 #gaga CMO</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlNsKM4zBJbCVCLLlbVqHR50I4zI.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FunRERqwnXLiwWmkYhkw9hwXs5y4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqKjZMOl8dPQf_Srai2pmbPqEkVL.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoafLxmxR67Y-r0gEmFmjtmkPGZg.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrNG1rt_wjwgUS1G6rvtQ_UnBnCB.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlzDMIU1d8AKKR3-qvpc0O17qfuB.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>gaga guest: Leon #GQ资深生活方式编辑</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgDEyHmAsdJBIEO7qeVATI6m0E4K.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>gaga host：大陶 #独立撰稿人/Modern Woman*主理人</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtBfcg4q4Y5Q-5lt8jivHc3UvWPv.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgP7TKeenjvNYaaDxNV3ITFhnY9p.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpwhPv29ARfwgsJZuqfGQwZGK_XB.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>timeline：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">01:38</a> 陈冠希最爱逛的涩谷Parco，非常好逛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="485">08:05</a> 东京的酒店推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="931">15:31</a> 东京每个区有很鲜明的特征，包括居住的人也因为区域有所不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1938">32:18</a> 日本的自然崇拜：神道教</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2098">34:58</a> 大陶在Fuji Rock见到了大野洋子！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2525">42:05</a> 贾老师小众日本自然+传统文化路线推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3035">50:35</a> 从花火大会领悟到日本“消逝”的美学</span></p><span></span><p><span>背景音乐来自音乐平台——网易云音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾音乐是和花火大会很应景的音乐： 《After Hanabi》—— Nujabes</span></p><span></span><p><span>贾老师微博：@Jennifer_Jiapp</span></p><span></span><p><span>大陶小红书：@大陶一直在玩</span></p><span></span><p><span>Leon小红书：@峰峰慢半拍</span></p>]]></description>
